WEBVTT

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:26.040
<b>Chaika the Coffin Princess</b>

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:26.790
<b>Chaika the Coffin Princess</b>

00:01:40.510 --> 00:01:41.740
Furom, iestrov...

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:43.640
Elmuto... Eril!

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:46.620
Natow!

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:48.370
Come, The Shtola!

00:01:50.620 --> 00:01:51.580
What?

00:01:51.970 --> 00:01:54.000
Come, tense atmosphere!

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:55.210
The Strays!

00:01:55.210 --> 00:01:56.590
Jentol, winsica!

00:02:08.610 --> 00:02:09.600
Finished already?

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:11.150
Do you surrender?

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:12.850
Not surrender!

00:02:12.850 --> 00:02:13.940
Chaika!

00:02:17.110 --> 00:02:20.610
A Wizard's Pride

00:02:21.050 --> 00:02:22.150
Chaika.

00:02:22.150 --> 00:02:23.320
Are you okay?

00:02:23.320 --> 00:02:24.340
Okay.

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:27.790
Ilm, es, alas!

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:45.190
Schu, limic...

00:02:45.190 --> 00:02:47.280
Come, that which bursts 
and scatters its mark!

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:49.060
The Burst!

00:02:58.610 --> 00:03:01.840
From one to the next... Typical saboteurs.

00:03:08.050 --> 00:03:09.200
Too bad for you!

00:03:10.230 --> 00:03:12.460
Anything else you're still hiding?

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:15.550
I can still fight.

00:03:15.550 --> 00:03:16.280
Yeah.

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:17.940
Didn't I tell you yesterday?

00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:21.490
A wizard's strength is 
supported by experience.

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:24.270
What you lack is experience.

00:03:26.270 --> 00:03:28.220
Blow away! The Blow!

00:03:32.930 --> 00:03:33.600
Chaika!

00:03:51.190 --> 00:03:53.680
Assa, schron, misam, winhel...

00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:55.790
Come, The Preventer!

00:03:57.680 --> 00:03:58.300
Chaika!

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:07.900
That's it for you, hero.

00:04:15.430 --> 00:04:17.270
Give remains!

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:21.770
What's wrong, Chaika?

00:04:21.770 --> 00:04:24.570
You just got your first 
remains. Aren't you happy?

00:04:24.940 --> 00:04:27.110
Why don't you celebrate a little?

00:04:27.110 --> 00:04:29.070
Nothing to celebrate.

00:04:29.070 --> 00:04:29.870
No?

00:04:31.030 --> 00:04:34.620
But, damn, that thing's pretty creepy.

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:37.380
Rude! Father's remains, sacred!

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:39.270
Sorry, sorry.

00:04:39.270 --> 00:04:41.920
I hope we can get to the 
next hero before the

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:44.010
white girl and her friends do.

00:04:44.010 --> 00:04:45.760
Yeah, while we're on a roll.

00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:50.000
You're strong.

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:52.560
Both mentally and physically.

00:04:52.880 --> 00:04:55.790
Once we're hired, we don't 
betray our employer.

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:58.560
That's the one thing we take pride in.

00:05:02.670 --> 00:05:06.780
What's wrong? Remembering that saboteur kid?

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:08.950
No! Absolute no!

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:10.710
Bingo, huh?

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:11.540
Ow!

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:14.270
That's dangerous! I'm driving here!

00:05:14.270 --> 00:05:16.160
It's your own fault for having no tact.

00:05:17.930 --> 00:05:20.170
Gather remains, objective...

00:05:21.680 --> 00:05:25.450
Fake white girl, father's funeral.

00:05:25.450 --> 00:05:27.760
Objective very clear.

00:05:28.630 --> 00:05:32.600
But my objective, revenge. Vague.

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:36.060
Specific circumstances, unclear.

00:05:38.220 --> 00:05:41.410
Won't you find that out 
once you gather them all?

00:05:41.410 --> 00:05:45.490
Yeah, that's right. 
So let's get as many as we can!

00:05:45.490 --> 00:05:46.610
Rude!

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:48.070
Okay, okay...

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:51.820
What's up?

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:53.240
Guy...

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:58.750
I see you've acquired Emperor Gaz's forearm.

00:05:59.530 --> 00:06:00.880
That's good to see.

00:06:01.140 --> 00:06:03.550
You just show up out of nowhere...

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:07.380
Whatever. We were just thinking 
we want to get ahead of the

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:09.360
white girl and the saboteur siblings.

00:06:09.740 --> 00:06:11.100
Where can we find the next remains?

00:06:11.780 --> 00:06:13.470
You brought information, right?

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:14.560
Yes, I did.

00:06:14.760 --> 00:06:15.980
Tell where!

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:19.880
In a fishing village by the ocean 
about a day's travel from here,

00:06:19.880 --> 00:06:22.140
there's a hero by the name of Clay Morgan.

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:24.120
We go, quickly!

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:25.990
No need to be in such a hurry.

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:27.870
I have one other bit of information.

00:06:27.870 --> 00:06:28.450
Tell!

00:06:29.170 --> 00:06:32.320
You might want to visit the 
island off the coast, as well.

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:33.950
Island?

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:37.300
I think you'll find 
something pleasing there.

00:06:40.090 --> 00:06:44.470
You want to keep Captain Gillette's 
belongings here, then?

00:06:44.470 --> 00:06:47.590
I want to leave things so that 
he can come back at any time.

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:51.110
That's why we're keeping the name 
of the Gillette Squad, too.

00:06:51.110 --> 00:06:53.770
Yes, I've heard from the chief.

00:06:56.290 --> 00:06:57.420
What's that?

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:09.360
We have no way to counter her...

00:07:09.670 --> 00:07:11.120
What happened to the traps?

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:12.500
She destroyed most of them.

00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:13.690
Damn it.

00:07:13.690 --> 00:07:15.020
Toru... Akari...

00:07:15.020 --> 00:07:16.390
Not surrender!

00:07:16.390 --> 00:07:17.700
Yeah, I know.

00:07:18.230 --> 00:07:20.220
We can't get any closer at all...

00:07:20.220 --> 00:07:22.710
If we just wait for her, 
she'll use it to her advantage.

00:07:23.690 --> 00:07:24.950
I'll be a decoy.

00:07:24.950 --> 00:07:26.640
Decoy, dangerous!

00:07:26.640 --> 00:07:29.210
If we stay here, we'll all be 
blown away along with this rock.

00:07:29.640 --> 00:07:32.470
It's do or die. We have 
to make a move. Got it?

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:33.530
Understood.

00:07:34.560 --> 00:07:36.870
I'll distract her as much as I can.

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:38.370
Akari, get to her from behind.

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:40.420
Chaika, don't panic.

00:07:40.420 --> 00:07:42.350
Just look for a place where 
you can take precise aim.

00:07:42.580 --> 00:07:44.860
Right. Precision, important.

00:07:45.090 --> 00:07:46.560
Okay. Let's go.

00:07:48.970 --> 00:07:50.620
I am steel.

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:53.700
Steel knows no fear. Steel knows no doubt.

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:57.330
When faced with my enemy, I hesitate not.

00:07:57.330 --> 00:07:59.330
I am a weapon to destroy these.

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:01.000
Iron-Blood Transformation!

00:08:12.080 --> 00:08:13.550
Trying to get me from behind, eh?

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:15.500
Alay, salama!

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:22.640
<i>That's it, Chaika! Keep going!</i>

00:08:23.050 --> 00:08:24.770
Sabah, amasala, missah!

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:28.320
The Sealed!

00:08:36.180 --> 00:08:36.950
Toru!

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:37.780
Brother!

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:51.310
Toru...

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:55.090
Salimic, binnu, alay...

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:02.160
Come, to strike and crush!

00:09:02.160 --> 00:09:03.560
The Slugger!

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:20.620
Ow...

00:09:23.560 --> 00:09:24.580
Toru!

00:09:28.230 --> 00:09:30.270
I am man.

00:09:33.160 --> 00:09:34.940
Toru! No problem?

00:09:34.940 --> 00:09:36.540
Yes, problem.

00:09:36.540 --> 00:09:37.810
Relieved.

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:39.690
What about you? Are you okay?

00:09:39.690 --> 00:09:42.430
Yes! Yuko, ippon, waza-ari!

00:09:42.770 --> 00:09:45.020
Yeah... We got her.

00:09:49.190 --> 00:09:51.090
So you can do it when you try.

00:09:55.960 --> 00:09:57.340
I've lost.

00:09:57.340 --> 00:10:00.240
Yes. Because of your advice.

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:01.660
That wasn't the only reason.

00:10:02.470 --> 00:10:04.500
Couldn't you tell?

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:09.290
A moment ago, you wished to protect 
him with all your strength.

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:14.130
A strong magical attack is most dependent 
upon a wizard's strong emotions.

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:22.280
Yes...

00:10:22.730 --> 00:10:24.470
Maybe you really are

00:10:25.400 --> 00:10:27.730
the daughter of the emperor.

00:10:29.530 --> 00:10:31.190
Understand, grateful.

00:10:33.790 --> 00:10:35.410
Fredrica!

00:10:35.410 --> 00:10:37.650
Oh... Is this cat yours?

00:10:39.260 --> 00:10:40.110
Yes!

00:10:43.840 --> 00:10:47.790
Lady Claudia, it is time.

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:50.930
You're such a pest. I know that.

00:10:50.930 --> 00:10:54.980
Yes, ma'am... I am sorry, 
but please return immediately.

00:10:54.980 --> 00:10:57.420
Our work is falling behind.

00:10:57.420 --> 00:10:59.370
Let's have tea first.

00:10:59.370 --> 00:11:01.280
We can spare that much time, right?

00:11:01.280 --> 00:11:03.320
Tea time, waited!

00:11:03.320 --> 00:11:04.880
Want grape everything!

00:11:20.350 --> 00:11:24.280
"A sword drawn at night can 
never again be sheathed."

00:11:25.060 --> 00:11:27.180
That's rather cryptic.

00:11:27.180 --> 00:11:28.520
Yes...

00:11:28.520 --> 00:11:31.890
But I'll take this fortune 
to heart and live by it.

00:11:32.820 --> 00:11:34.910
What does yours say?

00:11:34.910 --> 00:11:36.430
Mine says...

00:11:36.430 --> 00:11:40.330
"It is your unchanging love 
that will save your loved one."

00:11:44.820 --> 00:11:45.740
Vivi.

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:54.670
This is Captain Gillette's notebook. 
It was in the <i>April</i>.

00:11:55.780 --> 00:11:59.480
Captain Nikolai and I checked 
the contents earlier,

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:03.500
and it's packed with questions 
and observations regarding

00:12:03.500 --> 00:12:04.780
Chaika and Emperor Gaz.

00:12:05.710 --> 00:12:11.130
Do you not think it might be full of the 
captain's feelings on the Chaika case?

00:12:13.200 --> 00:12:17.990
Everything in here centers around materials 
seized from Emperor Gaz's castle.

00:12:18.470 --> 00:12:22.130
To tell the truth, I had not investigated 
this library in depth myself.

00:12:23.070 --> 00:12:26.130
As the notebook says, it seems unnatural

00:12:26.130 --> 00:12:30.630
that there are no materials left on the 
magic techniques used by such a wizard.

00:12:31.340 --> 00:12:35.220
So when I looked into these documents again,

00:12:35.220 --> 00:12:37.060
I found this.

00:12:37.550 --> 00:12:40.060
It's the report of the punitive 
force that killed Emperor Gaz.

00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:46.010
His fortune?

00:12:46.960 --> 00:12:50.660
Curren-san, is it all right if I keep these?

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:54.430
Of course. That's why I showed them to you.

00:12:55.480 --> 00:12:58.390
I will continue my investigation 
of this library.

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:02.460
I would like you to continue to 
pursue Chaika, as you always have.

00:13:03.790 --> 00:13:05.520
Yes. I will.

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:30.660
Chief Konrad.

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:32.010
What is it, Curren?

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:34.020
I just spoke with Vivi.

00:13:34.020 --> 00:13:35.210
I see...

00:13:35.510 --> 00:13:37.490
Now that the war is over,

00:13:37.490 --> 00:13:43.540
I never thought I'd be stricken with 
the loss of one of my men like this.

00:13:44.100 --> 00:13:44.850
Yes...

00:13:45.500 --> 00:13:49.820
Perhaps I should have listened 
more closely to Albéric.

00:13:50.240 --> 00:13:51.310
Yes.

00:13:51.620 --> 00:13:53.420
And what of Vivi?

00:13:53.420 --> 00:13:57.010
She is strong. She'll be fine.

00:13:59.010 --> 00:14:00.410
Also, Chief...

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:04.190
You've been smoking more cigarettes lately.

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:15.750
It's nothing special, but please enjoy.

00:14:19.110 --> 00:14:21.710
Grapes, exceptionally sweet!

00:14:22.280 --> 00:14:24.980
Fresh grapes, tart, exquisite!

00:14:25.330 --> 00:14:26.620
Bring it here.

00:14:26.620 --> 00:14:27.340
Yes, ma'am.

00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:34.210
The promised article.

00:14:34.210 --> 00:14:35.780
Father's remains?

00:14:35.780 --> 00:14:36.930
Yes.

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:39.110
So you weren't using it?

00:14:39.110 --> 00:14:40.260
The remains?

00:14:40.260 --> 00:14:40.770
Yeah.

00:14:41.620 --> 00:14:43.720
When I heard you had established a vineyard

00:14:43.720 --> 00:14:45.710
and winery like this after the war,

00:14:45.710 --> 00:14:49.240
I was sure you must have used the 
emperor's remains as magic fuel.

00:14:49.560 --> 00:14:53.470
Well, it's not as though the 
idea never occurred to me.

00:14:54.060 --> 00:14:57.200
If I had used it, I'm sure it would have 
kept my wine's flavor consistent.

00:14:57.620 --> 00:15:00.670
But for whatever reason, 
something held me back.

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:05.090
You're not like the other heroes we've met.

00:15:05.810 --> 00:15:06.760
No?

00:15:07.190 --> 00:15:11.360
Well, the punitive force had all 
sorts of unusual characters.

00:15:11.920 --> 00:15:15.350
Many of them lost their 
way once the war ended.

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:20.410
I didn't want to go through that, 
so I found a new purpose.

00:15:21.240 --> 00:15:25.100
And I received some of his remains 
as proof of my hero status,

00:15:25.100 --> 00:15:26.760
but it isn't mine.

00:15:27.210 --> 00:15:32.030
I had heard rumors that a girl called 
Chaika was gathering his remains,

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:34.970
so I had decided that if I met and 
liked her, I'd give it to her.

00:15:35.360 --> 00:15:38.910
It's better for his daughter to 
have them than for me to, right?

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:40.870
Grateful.

00:15:41.600 --> 00:15:44.380
By the way, do you know 
where his fortune is?

00:15:44.990 --> 00:15:47.130
Fortune? Fortune exists?!

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:49.370
Oh, you didn't know?

00:15:49.730 --> 00:15:53.730
When Gaz Castle fell, one of the 
surviving wizards spoke of it.

00:15:53.730 --> 00:15:56.010
He said there was a fortune 
left by the emperor.

00:16:03.870 --> 00:16:07.080
Please, spare my life!

00:16:07.080 --> 00:16:08.940
I'll give you information in return!

00:16:09.770 --> 00:16:10.650
Speak.

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:15.490
I am privy to Emperor Gaz's 
most guarded secret.

00:16:15.490 --> 00:16:16.520
What?

00:16:16.520 --> 00:16:19.320
A wizard recently departed 
for a foreign island

00:16:19.320 --> 00:16:22.160
after receiving an order from Emperor Gaz.

00:16:22.590 --> 00:16:26.250
The emperor's fortune is hidden there.

00:16:29.730 --> 00:16:31.260
I thank you for the information.

00:16:33.240 --> 00:16:38.350
However, we have orders to 
exterminate all within Gaz Castle.

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:42.180
We must not allow even 
a single mouse to live.

00:16:43.600 --> 00:16:47.220
The punitive force's record keeper 
reported a "secret island"

00:16:47.220 --> 00:16:50.760
and "the emperor's fortune" 
to the allied forces.

00:16:53.410 --> 00:16:55.320
Emperor's fortune, where now?!

00:16:56.390 --> 00:16:59.580
I've heard that the allied 
forces searched for it,

00:17:00.180 --> 00:17:02.780
but they never found anything.

00:17:02.780 --> 00:17:03.980
Nothing?

00:17:03.980 --> 00:17:06.540
The search was called off after that.

00:17:07.280 --> 00:17:09.730
After the castle fell, 
it was also searched again,

00:17:09.730 --> 00:17:14.510
but no experimental tools or documents 
were found on his magic techniques.

00:17:14.910 --> 00:17:18.350
It was assumed that the wizard 
who received Emperor Gaz's order

00:17:18.350 --> 00:17:21.810
must have taken it all 
with him to that island.

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:25.560
Island... Father's fortune...

00:17:25.950 --> 00:17:28.980
But I'm glad I was able 
to give you the remains.

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:30.060
Yes.

00:17:30.060 --> 00:17:32.080
Do you still intend to 
continue your journey?

00:17:32.080 --> 00:17:32.860
Yes.

00:17:33.340 --> 00:17:35.730
Then why don't I write down the locations

00:17:35.730 --> 00:17:37.120
where you're likely to find more remains?

00:17:37.120 --> 00:17:38.110
You know?

00:17:38.110 --> 00:17:42.870
Sure. I know the names and birthplaces 
of the other heroes, at least.

00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:45.370
There's still plenty more, 
so eat all you like.

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:48.700
My memory is vague, 
and it's been five years,

00:17:48.700 --> 00:17:51.340
so I couldn't say whether 
they're still around...

00:17:51.690 --> 00:17:54.530
Looks like our coming here has set 
things in motion quite rapidly.

00:17:54.530 --> 00:17:58.240
Yeah. No more wild goose chase for us.

00:17:58.600 --> 00:18:00.040
Right, Chaika?

00:18:06.670 --> 00:18:07.830
Grateful!

00:18:07.830 --> 00:18:11.940
But why leave so late at night? 
You could stay until morning.

00:18:12.170 --> 00:18:14.640
We are on the run, after all.

00:18:14.640 --> 00:18:17.290
Couldn't you at least have 
some wine before you go?

00:18:17.290 --> 00:18:19.100
I'm not interested in alcohol.

00:18:19.100 --> 00:18:21.950
But wine enriches your life.

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:23.660
Sounds like something a drunkard would say.

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:26.910
When you understand what it 
means, come visit again.

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:28.710
All right.

00:18:28.710 --> 00:18:29.670
Thank you.

00:18:30.110 --> 00:18:31.920
Many gifts, grateful!

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:34.800
Claudia's grapes, superb! Can never forget!

00:18:35.190 --> 00:18:37.840
Thank you. Take care, okay?

00:18:41.650 --> 00:18:43.580
Are you sure it was right

00:18:43.580 --> 00:18:46.770
to give it to a girl who may 
not even be the real daughter?

00:18:47.440 --> 00:18:50.700
That was like a badge of honor for you.

00:18:50.700 --> 00:18:54.700
That's no badge of honor. Just a trinket.

00:18:56.290 --> 00:19:02.600
I'll raise the value of my own badge 
of honor with this year's wine.

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:33.650
Chaika, what is it?

00:19:38.730 --> 00:19:41.590
What's wrong? Did you have a scary dream?

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:46.320
Gruesome memory... Beheading moment...

00:19:47.320 --> 00:19:52.370
But that memory, fake. 
If true, would be dead.

00:19:52.890 --> 00:19:55.430
Am I fake?

00:19:55.430 --> 00:19:58.340
First... What am I?

00:19:59.880 --> 00:20:02.460
Many Chaikas exist.

00:20:02.460 --> 00:20:05.300
Some say, emperor's real daughter, dead.

00:20:05.800 --> 00:20:08.430
My memories, turbid.

00:20:08.430 --> 00:20:10.360
Uncertainty swirling in heart.

00:20:12.540 --> 00:20:16.370
I can't blame you for feeling that way.

00:20:16.370 --> 00:20:19.440
But that doesn't change 
your objective, does it?

00:20:20.520 --> 00:20:23.160
Objective, gather remains.

00:20:23.160 --> 00:20:24.890
Father, funeral.

00:20:24.890 --> 00:20:28.240
Then all you can do is keep 
working toward that, right?

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:33.250
And all Akari and I need to do is make 
our master's objective a reality.

00:20:33.680 --> 00:20:35.070
Isn't that enough?

00:20:35.070 --> 00:20:37.310
Yes. That's what I think, too.

00:20:42.520 --> 00:20:44.640
Well, it's morning. Should we get going?

00:20:46.800 --> 00:20:47.700
Yes.

00:20:50.580 --> 00:20:54.550
You're one of the eight heroes, 
Glen Donkervoort, right?

00:20:55.090 --> 00:20:57.060
Yes, I suppose I am.

00:20:58.910 --> 00:21:01.490
You lot are quite skilled.

00:21:02.200 --> 00:21:04.580
How about you give us the emperor's remains?

00:21:05.430 --> 00:21:08.360
About that... The remains aren't here.

00:21:08.360 --> 00:21:09.080
Not here?

00:21:09.530 --> 00:21:12.830
I gave them to a girl in red yesterday.

00:21:13.190 --> 00:21:14.120
Red?

00:21:15.170 --> 00:21:16.540
The red Chaika?

00:21:18.200 --> 00:21:19.360
Chaika...

00:21:21.970 --> 00:21:24.810
So they were still gathering remains?

00:21:24.810 --> 00:21:27.050
They can't be very far.

00:21:27.440 --> 00:21:30.020
That only leaves the 
viscount Alan Tramontana,

00:21:30.020 --> 00:21:33.370
Lord Stephan Hartgen, and Clay Morgan...

00:21:33.890 --> 00:21:36.440
I don't want the red Chaika 
to get ahead of us.

00:21:37.300 --> 00:21:38.270
Chaika?

00:21:39.730 --> 00:21:43.070
Want to look for Father's island.

00:21:44.230 --> 00:21:48.270
If found, can learn what I am.

00:21:48.270 --> 00:21:49.530
Wait, you...

00:21:50.070 --> 00:21:51.980
What am I...

00:21:52.420 --> 00:21:54.520
Want to find answer.

00:23:25.580 --> 00:23:28.580
Hero living in harbor town, 
giant spear user.

00:23:28.580 --> 00:23:31.210
Also boss of marine shipping business!

00:23:31.210 --> 00:23:33.380
Boss powerful, bewildered!

00:23:33.380 --> 00:23:35.180
Want good seafood!

00:23:35.180 --> 00:23:37.530
But first, battle inevitable!

00:23:36.430 --> 00:23:39.940
The Harbor of Phantom Dreams Recollected

00:23:37.530 --> 00:23:39.940
Next time: 
"The Harbor of Phantom Dreams Recollected."
